		<RichText x="738" y="255" width="439" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">鍪甲兽连续进行抓、顶、甩3段攻击，依次造成<span color="#ffe599">70%,30%,30%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="479" width="423" height="56" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">鍪甲兽利用叉角进行顶击，造成<span color="#ffe599">50%</span><span>伤害。</span></p>
			</content>
		</RichText>
		<RichText x="738" y="703" width="439" height="114" kerning="off" blendMode="normal" whiteSpaceCollapse="preserve" alpha="0.9019607843137255">
			<content>
				<p fontFamily="仓耳渔阳体 W03" fontSize="24" fontWeight="bold" color="#ffffff">鍪甲兽凝聚自身元素，结成一枚岩晶，发射后追踪玩家，造成<span color="#ffe599">100%</span><span>伤害。受</span><span color="#bfcdff">「星烁反应」</span><span>影响后中断技能，并掉落2枚</span><span color="#ffe599">岩元素</span><span>微粒，之后不再施放本技能。</span></p>
			</content>
